      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ROCKATANSKY (5) recorded a win over the 390m at this track in a useful 21.76 last start. Has the ability and looks hard to top. ON WHEELS (3) hit the frame on debut (22.61) at this track then opened winning account at second run with a 1.5 lengths win (19.78) at Capalaba. The form out of last run is most impressive. Looks a key chance if runs up to latest figure. BOURBON AND COKE (1) finds it hard to break through. Finished in the minors latest when third (25.74) at this track and may be close to breaking through. Reliable out of the boxes and should take advantage of the inside draw. Will give a great sight again. ZIPPING MUSETTI (4) gets a chance to improve on an unplaced run at his latest outing at this circuit.",
